          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"services.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Services — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg1:linear-gradient(135deg,#F6F0FF 0%,#E8FFF4 100%);--accent:#6B4CFF;--muted:#6b6b6b;--card:#ffffff}\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,\\\"Helvetica Neue\\\",Arial}\\n    body{background:var(--bg1);color:#111;line-height:1.45}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:22px 28px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}\\n    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 20%,rgba(107,76,255,0.18),transparent 20%),linear-gradient(180deg,#FFF 0%,rgba(107,76,255,0.08) 100%);box-shadow:0 6px 22px rgba(107,76,255,0.08);font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}\\n    nav a{margin-left:14px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n    .cta{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#00C2A8);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n\\n    main{max-width:1100px;margin:28px auto;padding:28px}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:28px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:22px}\\n    .hero-card{background:var(--card);padding:26px;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(22,22,22,0.06)}\\n    .kicker{font-size:13px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.8px}\\n    h1{margin:8px 0 12px;font-size:28px}\\n    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    /* services grid */\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .svc{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(107,76,255,0.06)}\\n    .svc h3{margin:0 0 8px}\\n    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    /* plan block */\\n    .plan{display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:22px}\\n    .plan .step{flex:1;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(107,76,255,0.04),transparent);padding:16px;border-radius:10px}\\n\\n    /* micro habits */\\n    .habits{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:20px}\\n    .habit{flex:1;background:#fff;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border-left:4px solid #E8FDF6}\\n\\n    .pricing{margin-top:22px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff, #fbfbff);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(107,76,255,0.04)}\\n\\n    footer{margin-top:30px;padding:18px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n\\n    /* subtle SVG pattern positioned */\\n    .pattern{position:fixed;right:0;bottom:0;opacity:0.14;pointer-events:none;width:420px;height:420px}\\n\\n    @media(max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.pattern{width:260px;height:260px}}\\n    @media(max-width:560px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.brand .logo{width:44px;height:44px}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <svg class=\\\"pattern\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 200 200\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden>\\n    <!-- inline unique pattern; also mirrored concept for assets/img/pattern.svg -->\\n    <defs>\\n      <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n        <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#6B4CFF\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.18\\\"/>\\n        <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#00C2A8\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.06\\\"/>\\n      </linearGradient>\\n    </defs>\\n    <rect width=\\\"200\\\" height=\\\"200\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\" rx=\\\"24\\\"/>\\n    <g fill-opacity=\\\"0.08\\\" fill=\\\"#fff\\\">\\n      <circle cx=\\\"40\\\" cy=\\\"40\\\" r=\\\"22\\\"/>\\n      <circle cx=\\\"140\\\" cy=\\\"80\\\" r=\\\"14\\\"/>\\n      <circle cx=\\\"80\\\" cy=\\\"150\\\" r=\\\"26\\\"/>\\n    </g>\\n    <path d=\\\"M0 100 Q50 20 100 100 T200 100\\\" stroke=\\\"#fff\\\" stroke-opacity=\\\"0.06\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\"/>\\n  </svg>\\n\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"logo\\\">HM</div>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Services</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">How I Work</a>\\n      <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"hero-card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"kicker\\\">Holistic offerings</div>\\n        <h1>Personalized services that honor the whole person</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">We combine lifestyle coaching, gentle modalities, and evidence-informed education to reduce symptoms and improve resilience. No promises of cures — only a structured path toward better balance.</p>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n          <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Book an introductory visit</a>\\n          <span style=\\\"margin-left:12px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600\\\">or call {{PHONE}}</span>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"hero-card\\\">\\n        <strong style=\\\"font-size:14px;color:var(--accent)\\\">Today’s focus</strong>\\n        <p style=\\\"margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">A short consult + tailored recommendations you can act on within the first week.</p>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Practitioner: {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section>\\n      <div class=\\\"kicker\\\">Service catalog</div>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid\\\" role=\\\"list\\\">\\n        <article class=\\\"svc\\\" role=\\\"listitem\\\">\\n          <h3>Integrative Consult (60 min)</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Comprehensive intake to explore physical, emotional, and lifestyle contributors.</div>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px\\\">Review history, identify priorities, and co-create next steps focused on education and self-care.</p>\\n        </article>\\n        <article class=\\\"svc\\\" role=\\\"listitem\\\">\\n          <h3>Follow-up & Care Plan (30 min)</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Short, focused review to adjust interventions and track progress.</div>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px\\\">Ideal for refining nutrition, sleep strategies, and targeted micro-habits.</p>\\n        </article>\\n        <article class=\\\"svc\\\" role=\\\"listitem\\\">\\n          <h3>Nutrition & Lifestyle Coaching</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Practical, habit-focused guidance grounded in whole-person thinking.</div>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px\\\">Personalized plans that fit your routine and values; optional meal guides available as an add-on.</p>\\n        </article>\\n\\n        <article class=\\\"svc\\\" role=\\\"listitem\\\">\\n          <h3>Mind-Body Support</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Breathwork, guided practices, and stress resilience strategies.</div>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px\\\">Tools to reduce sympathetic activation and improve sleep quality over time.</p>\\n        </article>\\n        <article class=\\\"svc\\\" role=\\\"listitem\\\">\\n          <h3>Targeted Symptom Pathways</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Focused programs for digestion, inflammation, sleep, and low energy.</div>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px\\\">Education-first approach; lab options are discussed as part of shared decision-making.</p>\\n        </article>\\n        <article class=\\\"svc\\\" role=\\\"listitem\\\">\\n          <h3>Retail & Supplements (addon)</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Curated, science-aware options to support the plan.</div>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px\\\">Available as retail add-ons when appropriate; you’ll always receive evidence-based guidance on safety and interactions.</p>\\n        </article>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"plan\\\" aria-label=\\\"How a plan works\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n        <strong>Step 1 — Intake</strong>\\n        <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Listen + map out your health story.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n        <strong>Step 2 — Co-created plan</strong>\\n        <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Meaningful, small changes with measurable goals.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n        <strong>Step 3 — Support</strong>\\n        <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Follow-ups, adjustments, and optional labs only if helpful.</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"habits\\\" aria-label=\\\"micro habits\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"habit\\\">\\n        <strong>Daily breath reset</strong>\\n        <div class=\\\"meta\\\">3–5 minutes to lower stress reactivity.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"habit\\\">\\n        <strong>Sleep anchor</strong>\\n        <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Consistent bedtime ritual to signal rest.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"habit\\\">\\n        <strong>Mini movement</strong>\\n        <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Short walks or gentle stretching to support digestion and mood.</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"pricing\\\" aria-label=\\\"pricing snapshot\\\">\\n      <strong style=\\\"display:block;margin-bottom:8px\\\">Pricing highlights</strong>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:200px;padding:12px;background:#fff;border-radius:10px\\\">Initial consult — 60 min<br><strong>$175</strong></div>\\n        <div style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:200px;padding:12px;background:#fff;border-radius:10px\\\">Follow-up — 30 min<br><strong>$95</strong></div>\\n        <div style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:200px;padding:12px;background:#fff;border-radius:10px\\\">Coaching packages & add-ons<br><strong>varies</strong></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">Note: pricing is illustrative and may vary. Labs and supplements are optional and billed separately when used.</div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff,#f7fbff);padding:18px;border-radius:12px\\\">\\n      <strong>Ready to begin?</strong>\\n      <p style=\\\"margin:8px 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Schedule a thoughtful first visit to explore priorities and create a gentle plan.</p>\\n      <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n      <span style=\\\"margin-left:12px;color:var(--muted)\\\">or call {{PHONE}}</span>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </main>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"conditions.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Common Concerns — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:linear-gradient(180deg,#FEFCFF,#F0FFF9);--accent:#00C2A8;--text:#0b0b0b}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text)}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:18px 22px}\\n    .nav a{margin-left:12px;color:#4b5563;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n    .logo{font-weight:800;color:var(--accent)}\\n\\n    main{max-width:950px;margin:16px auto;padding:20px}\\n    .hero{background:#fff;padding:20px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(10,10,10,0.04)}\\n    h1{margin:0 0 8px}\\n    p.lead{margin:0;color:#556b6b}\\n\\n    .conditions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:16px}\\n    .cond{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfffe);padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border-left:3px solid rgba(0,194,168,0.14)}\\n    .cond h3{margin:0 0 6px}\\n    .cond p{margin:0;color:#616161;font-size:14px}\\n\\n    .disclaimer{margin-top:12px;color:#6b6b6b;font-size:13px}\\n    .micro{margin-top:18px;background:#fff;padding:14px;border-radius:10px}\\n\\n    .cta-block{margin-top:18px;text-align:center}\\n    .cta{background:var(--accent);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n\\n    .svg-edge{position:fixed;left:0;top:0;opacity:0.06;width:280px;height:280px;pointer-events:none}\\n\\n    @media(max-width:700px){.conditions{grid-template-columns:1fr}.svg-edge{display:none}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <svg class=\\\"svg-edge\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 200 200\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n    <!-- Unique decorative pattern; could be exported to assets/img/pattern.svg for reuse -->\\n    <defs>\\n      <linearGradient id=\\\"a\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n        <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#00C2A8\\\"/>\\n        <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#6B4CFF\\\"/>\\n      </linearGradient>\\n    </defs>\\n    <rect width=\\\"200\\\" height=\\\"200\\\" rx=\\\"40\\\" fill=\\\"url(#a)\\\"/>\\n    <g fill=\\\"#fff\\\" fill-opacity=\\\"0.06\\\">\\n      <rect x=\\\"18\\\" y=\\\"28\\\" width=\\\"160\\\" height=\\\"12\\\" rx=\\\"6\\\"/>\\n      <rect x=\\\"30\\\" y=\\\"60\\\" width=\\\"120\\\" height=\\\"12\\\" rx=\\\"6\\\"/>\\n      <rect x=\\\"60\\\" y=\\\"100\\\" width=\\\"70\\\" height=\\\"12\\\" rx=\\\"6\\\"/>\\n    </g>\\n  </svg>\\n\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"logo\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n    <div class=\\\"nav\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Offerings</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Method</a>\\n      <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <h1>What people commonly bring to a holistic visit</h1>\\n      <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Below are common concerns addressed in whole-person care. Each entry describes typical contributors and educational approaches we use. This is not an exhaustive list and not medical advice.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"conditions\\\" aria-label=\\\"conditions list\\\">\\n      <article class=\\\"cond\\\">\\n        <h3>Stress & Overwhelm</h3>\\n        <p>Chronic stress shows up as fatigue, low mood, and sleep disruption. Interventions focus on breathing practices, pacing, and identifying small behavioural changes to restore resilience.</p>\\n      </article>\\n\\n      <article class=\\\"cond\\\">\\n        <h3>Sleep Difficulties</h3>\\n        <p>Insomnia and fragmented sleep often relate to routine, screen exposure, and stress hormones. We prioritize sleep hygiene, bedtime rituals, and circadian-supporting habits before considering other options.</p>\\n      </article>\\n\\n      <article class=\\\"cond\\\">\\n        <h3>Digestive Complaints</h3>\\n        <p>Bloating, irregularity, or discomfort are assessed for dietary patterns, stress responses, and lifestyle. Education and gentle elimination strategies are used; labs may be discussed when appropriate.</p>\\n      </article>\\n\\n      <article class=\\\"cond\\\">\\n        <h3>Low Energy & Fatigue</h3>\\n        <p>Fatigue can be multi-factorial. We explore sleep, nutrition, movement, and psychosocial context, emphasizing graded steps that return energy sustainably rather than quick fixes.</p>\\n      </article>\\n\\n      <article class=\\\"cond\\\">\\n        <h3>Chronic Inflammation & Aches</h3>\\n        <p>Persistent inflammation is approached through diet patterns, movement, sleep, and stress management. Any use of supplements or labs is guided by safety and evidence.</p>\\n      </article>\\n\\n      <article class=\\\"cond\\\">\\n        <h3>Anxiety & Mood Variability</h3>\\n        <p>Treating emotions includes psychoeducation, lifestyle supports, and referral when specialized mental health care is needed. Our role emphasizes skills and rhythm-building.</p>\\n      </article>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"disclaimer\\\">\\n      Important: This information is educational and not a guarantee of outcome. For urgent symptoms, severe or progressive conditions, or emergencies, please seek immediate medical attention or your primary care provider.\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"micro\\\" aria-label=\\\"micro habits\\\">\\n      <strong>Simple daily actions that support many concerns</strong>\\n      <ul style=\\\"margin:8px 0 0;padding-left:18px;color:#525252\\\">\\n        <li>5-minute morning breathing or grounding practice</li>\\n        <li>Consistent sleep schedule — same rise and rest window</li>\\n        <li>Include small movement breaks after meals to aid digestion</li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"cta-block\\\">\\n      <p style=\\\"color:#526c66\\\">Curious whether a holistic approach fits your needs? Schedule a conversation to learn more.</p>\\n      <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <footer style=\\\"margin-top:24px;color:#6b6b6b;text-align:center;font-size:13px\\\">\\n      {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a>\\n    </footer>\\n  </main>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"approach.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Approach & Process — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fff;--primary:#6B4CFF;--muted:#555}\\n    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#FAFBFF,#FDFDFD);color:#111}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 26px}\\n    .nav a{margin-left:12px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}\\n    main{max-width:980px;margin:22px auto;padding:20px}\\n\\n    .intro{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center}\\n    .intro .card{flex:1;background:white;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(12,22,80,0.04)}\\n    .intro svg{width:120px;height:120px}\\n\\n    .flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .step{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfbff);padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(107,76,255,0.06)}\\n    .step h4{margin:0 0 8px}\\n\\n    .details{margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:18px}\\n    .details .panel{flex:1;background:#fff;padding:16px;border-radius:12px}\\n\\n    .labs{margin-top:14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff,#f6fffb);padding:12px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .cta{margin-top:18px}\\n\\n    footer{margin-top:26px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;text-align:center}\\n\\n    @media(max-width:860px){.flow{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.details{flex-direction:column}}\\n    @media(max-width:460px){.flow{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n    <div class=\\\"nav\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Welcome</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Treatments</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"conditions.html\\\">Concerns</a>\\n      <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n    </div>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <section class=\\\"intro\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--primary);font-weight:700\\\">Our philosophy</div>\\n        <h2 style=\\\"margin:8px 0\\\">An integrative path centered on education and partnership</h2>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">We meet you where you are, review your story, and build a stepwise plan emphasizing safety, measurable small changes, and durable habits. Nothing is forced — options are discussed and consented.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 48 48\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden>\\n        <defs>\\n          <linearGradient id=\\\"lg\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#6B4CFF\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#00C2A8\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n        </defs>\\n        <rect width=\\\"48\\\" height=\\\"48\\\" rx=\\\"10\\\" fill=\\\"url(#lg)\\\" opacity=\\\"0.14\\\"/>\\n        <g fill=\\\"#fff\\\">\\n          <path d=\\\"M24 8c-1 0-2 .8-2 2v10h12c0-5.5-4.5-12-10-12z\\\" opacity=\\\"0.9\\\"/>\\n          <circle cx=\\\"20\\\" cy=\\\"32\\\" r=\\\"8\\\" opacity=\\\"0.9\\\"/>\\n        </g>\\n      </svg>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"flow\\\" aria-label=\\\"care flow\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n        <h4>Intake</h4>\\n        <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Deep listening: history, priorities, and context. We use questionnaires as a starting point.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n        <h4>Diagnostic reasoning</h4>\\n        <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Synthesis of symptoms, patterns, and basic labs when relevant; an educational review of findings.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n        <h4>Plan</h4>\\n        <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Specific, time-bound goals plus micro-habits and resources to try in a defined interval.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n        <h4>Follow-ups</h4>\\n        <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Iterative support to refine the plan and address barriers as they arise.</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"details\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n        <h3>Assessments & testing (educational)</h3>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">We prioritize non-invasive assessments: thorough history, symptom mapping, and lifestyle review. Labs are optional and discussed transparently: we explain why a test might help, its limits, and costs.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"labs\\\">\\n          <strong>Common optional labs</strong>\\n          <ul style=\\\"margin:8px 0 0;padding-left:18px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n            <li>Basic metabolic markers (when clinically indicated)</li>\\n            <li>Targeted nutritional markers (B12, vitamin D, iron panels)</li>\\n            <li>Selected inflammatory or endocrine studies as education tools</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n        <h3>What a typical plan looks like</h3>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Plans combine behavior nudges, sleep and stress strategies, and modest dietary shifts. Interventions are chosen for feasibility and monitored over weeks. Supplements or referrals are only added when clearly helpful.</p>\\n\\n        <h4 style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">Example timeline</h4>\\n        <ol style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n          <li>Week 0 — Intake & goal-setting</li>\\n          <li>Weeks 1–4 — Try micro-habit interventions and track</li>\\n          <li>Week 6 — Follow-up to measure progress and adjust</li>\\n        </ol>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <h3>Follow-ups and support</h3>\\n      <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Follow-ups can be brief and focused. We use outcome-focused measures and adapt with an aim toward independence: fewer interventions as resilience improves.</p>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <strong>Micro-habit examples</strong>\\n        <ul style=\\\"margin:8px 0;padding-left:18px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n          <li>Two-minute morning movement + hydration</li>\\n          <li>Evening wind-down: low-light and a brief breathing routine</li>\\n          <li>Digestive rhythm: small post-meal stroll or gentle belly massage</li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"cta\\\">\\n      <a href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" style=\\\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,#6B4CFF,#00C2A8);color:#fff;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700\\\">Start with an intake</a>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Questions? Email <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> or call {{PHONE}}</div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </main>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
